WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.160
Welcome to ASH Workspace Gold.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:08.660
Contracts, emails, invoices, photos, deadlines,
and various statements can quickly become confusing.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:14.120
ASH Workspace Gold brings all this information
together in a secure digital workspace.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:19.990
You describe a case in writing or by microphone, take
photos, scan, or upload documents, and assign

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.970
everything to the correct process.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:27.730
The application recognizes and structures content,
checks document quality, and identifies gaps,

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.440
contradictions, and evidence.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.870
Risks are displayed in an
easy-to-understand traffic light system.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:37.880
Deadlines, next steps, and the processing
history remain fully traceable.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:44.930
For cross-border processes, home country, destination
country, and legal jurisdictions can be compared on a

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:46.040
case-by-case basis.

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:49.460
Sources and unverified points are clearly marked.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:53.850
Response letters can be prepared
in two languages of your choice.

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:58.760
Interface, input, and output
are configured independently.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:03.000
Results can be exported as PDF,
Word, Excel, or PowerPoint.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:08.990
Before saving, exporting, or sharing, you see a
full preview and make the final decision yourself.

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:13.160
Data protection and AI permissions
remain under your control.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:18.980
ASH Workspace Gold does not replace personal advice
from lawyers, authorities, or other specialists.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:25.520
It helps you to consolidate documents in an organized
way, understand the facts, and prepare concrete next steps.

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:30.550
You can start with three documents for free,
with no automatic renewal.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:34.560
Only when you need more do you transparently
choose a suitable product level.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:40.690
ASH Workspace Gold: Clarity, control,
and clear results in one workspace.